# Upload to /home/enroll/public_html/api.enroll.lilbrahmas.org/.htaccess
#   (owner: enroll, mode 644)
#
# Belt and braces alongside the exclusions in the parent .htaccess.
#
# Nearly every request to api.enroll.lilbrahmas.org is handled by ProxyPass to
# Envoy on 127.0.0.1:8000 and never touches the filesystem at all. The one
# exception is /.well-known/, which the vhost deliberately excludes from the
# proxy ("ProxyPass /.well-known/ !") so AutoSSL can validate over plain HTTP.
#
# That excluded path DOES hit the filesystem, which means a rewrite inherited
# from the parent directory could still capture it. Turning the engine off here
# guarantees ACME challenge files are served as plain static files.

RewriteEngine Off
